# fixture: home-sold-by-its-rule  (adversarial)
#
# one rule with both halves: the home pays its property costs from the
# brokerage monthly, and sends its sale to the brokerage at close (it
# finishes in June 2027 and closes in July). The halves move money opposite
# ways, into the home and out of it; read as one direction, the sale
# proceeds went unclaimed.

